<title>HUNGARY: Hungary prelim Aug foreign currency reserve $9.4 bln.</title>
<headline>Hungary prelim Aug foreign currency reserve $9.4 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The foreign currency reserves of the National Bank of Hungary totalled $9.4 billion in August according to preliminary figures, the central bank said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The amount of the foreign currency reserves was unchanged from July.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom ++ 36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
